msgid "Matrix operations"
msgstr "矩阵运算"

msgid ""
"``MATROP`` performs simple matrix manipulations for matrices whose "
"dimensions are those of the one particle basis set. To do so, first required"
" matrices are loaded into memory using the ``LOAD`` command. To each matrix "
"an internal *name* (an arbitrary user defined string) is assigned, by which "
"it is referenced in further commands. After performing operations, the "
"resulting matrices can be saved to a dump record using the ``SAVE`` "
"directive. Numbers, e.g. traces or individual matrix elements, can be saved "
"in variables."
msgstr ""
"``MATROP`` 对维度为单粒子基组的矩阵执行简单的矩阵操作。为此，首先使用 ``LOAD`` "
"命令将所需矩阵加载到内存中。为每个矩阵分配一个内部\\ *名称*\\ （用户定义的任意字符串），后续命令通过该名称引用它。执行操作后，可以使用 "
"``SAVE`` 指令将结果矩阵保存到转储记录中。数值，例如迹或单个矩阵元，可以保存在变量中。"

msgid "*code* may be one of the following:"
msgstr "*code* 可以是以下之一："

msgid "``LOAD`` Loads a matrix from a file"
msgstr "``LOAD`` 从文件加载矩阵"

msgid "``SAVE`` Saves a matrix to a file"
msgstr "``SAVE`` 将矩阵保存到文件"

msgid "``ADD`` Adds matrices"
msgstr "``ADD`` 矩阵相加"

msgid ""
"``TRACE`` Forms the trace of a matrix or of the product of two matrices"
msgstr "``TRACE`` 计算矩阵或两个矩阵乘积的迹"

msgid "``MULT`` Multiplies two matrices"
msgstr "``MULT`` 将两个矩阵相乘"

msgid "``TRAN`` Transforms a matrix"
msgstr "``TRAN`` 变换一个矩阵"

msgid "``DMO`` Transforms density into MO basis"
msgstr "``DMO`` 将密度变换到 MO 基"

msgid "``NATORB`` Computes natural orbitals"
msgstr "``NATORB`` 计算自然轨道"

msgid "``DIAG`` Diagonalizes a matrix"
msgstr "``DIAG`` 对角化一个矩阵"

msgid "``OPRD`` Forms an outer product of two vectors"
msgstr "``OPRD`` 形成两个向量的外积"

msgid "``DENS`` Forms a closed-shell density matrix"
msgstr "``DENS`` 形成闭壳层密度矩阵"

msgid "``FOCK`` Computes a closed-shell fock matrix"
msgstr "``FOCK`` 计算闭壳层 Fock 矩阵"

msgid "``COUL`` Computes a coulomb operator"
msgstr "``COUL`` 计算 Coulomb 算符"

msgid "``EXCH`` Computes an exchange operator"
msgstr "``EXCH`` 计算交换算符"

msgid "``PRINT`` Prints a matrix"
msgstr "``PRINT`` 打印矩阵"

msgid "``PRID`` Prints diagonal elements of a matrix"
msgstr "``PRID`` 打印矩阵的对角元"

msgid "``PRIO`` Prints orbitals"
msgstr "``PRIO`` 打印轨道"

msgid "``PRIC`` Prints the transpose of a matrix in scientific notation"
msgstr "``PRIC`` 以科学计数法打印矩阵的转置"

msgid "``ELEM`` Assigns a matrix element to a variable"
msgstr "``ELEM`` 将矩阵元赋值给变量"

msgid "``READ`` Reads a square matrix from input"
msgstr "``READ`` 从输入读取方阵"

msgid "``WRITE`` Writes a square matrix to a file"
msgstr "``WRITE`` 将方阵写入文件"

msgid "``SET`` Assigns a value to a variable"
msgstr "``SET`` 为变量赋值"

msgid ""
"``ADDVEC`` Adds a multiple of a column of one matrix to a column of a second"
" matrix"
msgstr "``ADDVEC`` 将一个矩阵的列的倍数加到第二个矩阵的列上"

msgid ""
"Note that the file name appearing in above commands is converted to lower "
"case on unix machines."
msgstr "请注意，上述命令中出现的文件名在 Unix 机器上会被转换为小写。"

msgid "See the following subsections for explanations."
msgstr "请参阅以下小节了解详细说明。"

msgid "Calling the matrix facility (MATROP)"
msgstr "调用矩阵工具 (MATROP)"

msgid ""
"The program is called by the input card ``MATROP`` without further "
"specifications."
msgstr "该程序由输入卡片 ``MATROP`` 调用，无需进一步说明。"

msgid "``MATROP``"
msgstr "``MATROP``"

msgid ""
"It can be followed by the following commands in any order, with the "
"restriction that a maximum of 50 matrices can be handled. The first entry in"
" each command line is a command keyword, followed by the name of the result "
"matrix. If the specified result matrix *result* already exists, it is "
"overwritten, otherwise a new matrix is created. All matrices needed in the "
"operations must must have been loaded or defined before, unless otherwise "
"stated."
msgstr ""
"其后可按任意顺序跟随以下命令，但限制最多可处理50个矩阵。每个命令行的第一个条目是命令关键字，其后是结果矩阵的名称。如果指定的结果矩阵 *result*"
" 已存在，则会被覆盖，否则将创建一个新矩阵。除非另有说明，否则操作所需的所有矩阵必须事先加载或定义。"

msgid "If a backquote (‘) is appended to a name, the matrix is transposed."
msgstr "如果在名称后附加反引号（‘），则矩阵将被转置。"

msgid "Loading matrices (LOAD)"
msgstr "加载矩阵（LOAD）"

msgid ""
"All matrices which are needed in any of the subsequent commands must first "
"be loaded into memory using the ``LOAD`` command. Depending on the matrix "
"type, the ``LOAD`` command has slightly different options. In all forms of "
"``LOAD`` *name* is an arbitrary string (up to 16 characters long) by which "
"the loaded matrix is denoted in subsequent commands."
msgstr ""
"后续命令中所需的所有矩阵必须首先使用 ``LOAD`` 命令加载到内存中。根据矩阵类型，\\ ``LOAD`` 命令的选项略有不同。在所有形式的 "
"``LOAD`` 中，\\ *name* 是一个任意字符串（最长16个字符），用于在后续命令中表示已加载的矩阵。"

msgid "Loading orbitals"
msgstr "加载轨道"

msgid ""
"loads an orbital coefficient matrix from the given dump record. If the "
"record is not specified, the last dump record is used. Specific orbitals "
"sets can be selected using the optional *specifications*, as explained in "
"section `selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__. The keyword ``ORB`` needs not to be given if *name*\\ "
"=\\ ``ORB``."
msgstr ""
"从给定的转储记录加载轨道系数矩阵。如果未指定记录，则使用最后一个转储记录。可以使用可选的 *specifications* 选择特定的轨道集，如章节 "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 所述。如果 *name*\\ =\\ ``ORB``\\ ，则无需给出关键字 ``ORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Loading density matrices"
msgstr "加载密度矩阵"

msgid ""
"loads a density matrix from the given dump record. If the record is not "
"given, the last dump record is used. Specific densities sets can be selected"
" using the optional *specifications*, as explained in section `selecting "
"orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__. The keyword ``DEN`` needs not to be given if *name*\\ "
"=\\ ``DEN``."
msgstr ""
"从给定的转储记录加载密度矩阵。如果未指定记录，则使用最后一个转储记录。可以使用可选的 *specifications* 选择特定的密度集，如章节 "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 中所述。如果 *name*\\ =\\ ``DEN``\\ ，则无需给出关键字 ``DEN``\\ 。"

msgid "Example,"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "``load,trdm,dens,6000.2,stateb=1.1,statek=3.2``"
msgstr "``load,trdm,dens,6000.2,stateb=1.1,statek=3.2``"

msgid ""
"loads a transition density matrix that has previously been saved on record "
"6000.2. The bra state is the first state in symmetry 1, and ket is the third"
" state in symmetry 2."
msgstr "加载先前保存在记录 6000.2 上的跃迁密度矩阵。Bra 态是第 1 个对称性中的第一个态，Ket 是第 2 个对称性中的第三个态。"

msgid "An equivalent input would be"
msgstr "一个等效的输入将是"

msgid "``load,trdm,dens,6000.2,stateb=1,statek=3,symb=1,symk=2``"
msgstr "``load,trdm,dens,6000.2,stateb=1,statek=3,symb=1,symk=2``"

msgid "Loading the AO overlap matrix S"
msgstr "加载 AO 重叠矩阵 S"

msgid ""
"loads the overlap matrix in the AO basis. The keyword ``S`` needs not to be "
"given if *name*\\ =\\ ``S``."
msgstr "加载原子轨道基组中的重叠矩阵。如果 *name*\\ =\\ ``S``\\ ，则无需给出关键字 ``S``\\ 。"

msgid "Loading S^{-1/2}"
msgstr "加载 S^{-1/2}"

msgid ""
"loads :math:`{\\bf S}^{-1/2}`, where **S** is the overlap matrix in the AO "
"basis. The keyword ``SMH`` needs not to be given if *name*\\ =\\ ``SMH``."
msgstr ""
"加载 :math:`{\\bf S}^{-1/2}`\\ ，其中 **S** 是原子轨道基组中的重叠矩阵。如果 *name*\\ =\\ "
"``SMH``\\ ，则无需给出关键字 ``SMH``\\ 。"

msgid "Loading the one-electron hamiltonian"
msgstr "加载单电子哈密顿量"

msgid ""
"loads the one-electron hamiltonian in the AO basis. ``H01`` differs from "
"``H0`` by the addition of perturbations, if present (see sections `dipole "
"fields (DIP) <properties_and_expectation_values.html#dipole-fields-dip>`__, "
"`quadrupole fields (QUAD) "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#quadrupole-fields-quad>`__). The "
"keyword ``H0`` (``H01``) needs not to be given if *name*\\ =\\ ``H0`` "
"(``H01``). The nuclear energy associated to ``H0`` or ``H01`` is internally "
"stored."
msgstr ""
"在原子轨道基组中加载单电子哈密顿量。如果存在微扰，\\ ``H01`` 与 ``H0`` 的区别在于增加了微扰项（参见章节 `偶极场 (DIP) "
"<properties_and_expectation_values.html#dipole-fields-dip>`__\\ 、\\ `四极场 "
"(QUAD) <properties_and_expectation_values.html#quadrupole-fields-quad>`__\\ "
"）。如果 *name*\\ =\\ ``H0`` (``H01``)，则无需给出关键字 ``H0`` (``H01``)。与 ``H0`` 或 "
"``H01`` 相关的核能量在内部存储。"

msgid "Loading the kinetic or potential energy operators"
msgstr "加载动能或势能算符"

msgid ""
"loads the individual parts of the one-electron hamiltonian in the AO basis. "
"``EPOT`` is summed for all atoms. The nuclear energy is associated to "
"``EPOT`` and internally stored. The keyword ``EKIN`` (``EPOT``) needs not to"
" be given if *name*\\ =\\ ``EKIN`` (``EPOT``)."
msgstr ""
"在原子轨道基组中加载单电子哈密顿量的各个部分。\\ ``EPOT`` 对所有原子求和。核能量与 ``EPOT`` 关联并在内部存储。如果 "
"*name*\\ =\\ ``EKIN`` (``EPOT``)，则无需给出关键字 ``EKIN`` (``EPOT``)。"

msgid "Loading one-electron property operators"
msgstr "加载单电子性质算符"

msgid ""
"If the operator is not available yet in the operator record, it is "
"automatically computed. The nuclear value is associated internally to *name*"
" and also stored in variable ``OPNUC`` (this variable is overwritten for "
"each operator which is loaded, but can be copied to another variable using "
"the ``SET`` command. Note that the electronic part of dipole and quadrupole "
"operators are multiplied by -1."
msgstr ""
"如果算符记录中尚无可用的算符，则会自动计算。核值在内部与 *name* 关联，并存储在变量 ``OPNUC`` "
"中（此变量会为每个加载的算符被覆盖，但可以使用 ``SET`` 命令将其复制到另一个变量）。请注意，偶极和四极矩算符的电子部分乘以了 -1。"

msgid "Loading matrices from plain records"
msgstr "从普通记录加载矩阵"

msgid ""
"Loads a triangular or square matrix from a plain record (not a dump record "
"or operator record). If *isym* is not given, 1 is assumed."
msgstr "从普通记录（非转储记录或算符记录）加载三角矩阵或方阵。如果未给出 *isym*\\ ，则假定为 1。"

msgid "Saving matrices (SAVE)"
msgstr "保存矩阵 (SAVE)"

msgid ""
"At present, *type* can be ``DENSITY``, ``ORBITALS``, ``FOCK``, ``H0``, "
"``ORBEN``, ``OPER``, ``TRIANG``, ``SQUARE``, or ``VECTOR``. If *type* and/or"
" *subtype* are not given but known from ``LOAD`` or another command, this is"
" assumed. *subtype* can for example be ``ALPHA`` or ``BETA`` for UHF "
"orbitals, or ``NATORB`` for natural orbitals. Orbitals, density matrices, "
"fock matrices, and orbital energies are saved to a dump record (the same one"
" should normally be used for all these quantities); if *record* is textual "
"rather than a number, it will instead be interpreted as a file name, and the"
" data will be written in `FCIDUMP <https://gitlab.com/molpro/fcidump>`__ "
"format to that file. If *type* is ``H0``, the one-electron hamiltonian is "
"overwritten by the current matrix and the nuclear energy is modified "
"according to the value associated to *name*. The nuclear energy is also "
"stored in the variable ``ENUC``. All other matrices can be saved in "
"triangular or square form to plain records using the ``TRIANG`` and "
"``SQUARE`` options, respectively (for triangular storage, the matrix is "
"symmetrized before being stored). Eigenvectors can be saved in plain records"
" using the ``VECTOR`` option. Only one matrix or vector can be stored in "
"each plain record."
msgstr ""
"目前，\\ *type* 可以是 ``DENSITY``\\ 、\\ ``ORBITALS``\\ 、\\ ``FOCK``\\ 、\\ "
"``H0``\\ 、\\ ``ORBEN``\\ 、\\ ``OPER``\\ 、\\ ``TRIANG``\\ 、\\ ``SQUARE`` 或 "
"``VECTOR``\\ 。如果未给出 *type* 和/或 *subtype*\\ ，但可以从 ``LOAD`` 或其他命令中得知，则采用已知值。\\"
" *subtype* 可以是例如 UHF 轨道的 ``ALPHA`` 或 ``BETA``\\ ，或自然轨道的 ``NATORB``\\ "
"。轨道、密度矩阵、Fock 矩阵和轨道能量被保存到转储记录中（通常应对所有这些量使用同一个记录）；如果 *record* "
"是文本而非数字，则它将被解释为文件名，数据将以 `FCIDUMP <https://gitlab.com/molpro/fcidump>`__ "
"格式写入该文件。如果 *type* 是 ``H0``\\ ，则单电子哈密顿量将被当前矩阵覆盖，并且核能量会根据与 *name* "
"关联的值进行修改。核能量也存储在变量 ``ENUC`` 中。所有其他矩阵可以分别使用 ``TRIANG`` 和 ``SQUARE`` "
"选项以三角形式或方阵形式保存到普通记录中（对于三角存储，矩阵在存储前会被对称化）。特征向量可以使用 ``VECTOR`` "
"选项保存到普通记录中。每个普通记录只能存储一个矩阵或向量。"

msgid "One-electron operators can be stored in the operator record using"
msgstr "单电子算符可以使用以下命令存储在算符记录中"

msgid ""
"The user-defined operator *name* can can then be used on subsequent "
"``EXPEC`` or ``GEXPEC`` cards. :math:`np=1,0,-1` for symmetric, square, "
"antisymmetric operators, respectively (default 1). If ``CENTRE`` is "
"specified, the operator is assumed to have its origin at the given centre, "
"where *icen* refers to the row number of the z-matrix input. The coordinates"
" can also be specified explicitly using ``COORD``. By default, the "
"coordinates of the last read operator are assumed, or otherwise zero."
msgstr ""
"用户定义的算符 *name* 随后可在后续的 ``EXPEC`` 或 ``GEXPEC`` 卡片中使用。\\ :math:`np=1,0,-1` "
"分别对应对称、方形、反对称算符（默认为1）。如果指定了 ``CENTRE``\\ ，则假定算符的原点位于给定的中心，其中 *icen* 指 "
"Z-矩阵输入的行号。也可以使用 ``COORD`` 显式指定坐标。默认情况下，假定为最后读取的算符的坐标，否则为零。"

msgid ""
"If ``NATURAL`` orbitals are generated and saved in a dump record, the "
"occupation numbers are automatically stored as well. This is convenient for "
"later use, e.g., in ``MOLDEN``."
msgstr "如果生成并保存了 ``NATURAL`` 轨道到转储记录中，占据数也会自动存储。这便于后续使用，例如在 ``MOLDEN`` 中。"

msgid "Adding matrices (ADD)"
msgstr "矩阵相加 (ADD)"

msgid ""
"The strings *result*, *mat1*, *mat2* are internal names specifying the "
"matrices. *mat1*, *mat2* must exist, otherwise an error occurs. If *result* "
"does not exist, it is created."
msgstr ""
"字符串 *result*\\ 、\\ *mat1*\\ 、\\ *mat2* 是指定矩阵的内部名称。\\ *mat1*\\ 、\\ *mat2* "
"必须存在，否则会发生错误。如果 *result* 不存在，则创建它。"

msgid ""
"The factors *fac1*, *fac2* are optional (may be variables). If not given, "
"one is assumed."
msgstr "因子 *fac1*\\ 、\\ *fac2* 是可选的（可以是变量）。如果未给出，则假定为1。"

msgid ""
"The nuclear values associated to the individual matrices are added "
"accordingly and the result is associated to *result*."
msgstr "各个矩阵关联的核值被相应相加，结果关联到 *result*\\ 。"

msgid "Trace of a matrix or the product of two matrices (TRACE)"
msgstr "矩阵或两个矩阵乘积的迹 (TRACE)"

msgid "Computes *variable* = *factor*\\*tr(*mat1*)."
msgstr "计算 *variable* = *factor*\\ \\*tr(*\\ mat1*)。"

msgid ""
"The result of the trace operation is stored in the ``MOLPRO`` variable "
"*variable*, which can be used in subsequent operations."
msgstr "迹运算的结果存储在 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 *variable* 中，该变量可在后续运算中使用。"

msgid ""
"If *factor* is not given, one is assumed. If *facnuc* is given, the nuclear "
"contribution multiplied by facnuc is added. It is assumed that either *mat1*"
" or *mat2* has a nuclear contribution. The default for *facnuc* is zero."
msgstr ""
"如果未指定 *factor*\\ ，则假定为 1。如果指定了 *facnuc*\\ ，则加上乘以 facnuc 的核贡献。假定 *mat1* 或 "
"*mat2* 具有核贡献。\\ *facnuc* 的默认值为零。"

msgid "Setting variables (SET)"
msgstr "设置变量（SET）"

msgid ""
"Assigns *value* to ``MOLPRO`` variable *variable*, where *value* can be an "
"expression involving any number of variables or numbers. Indexing of "
"*variable* is not possible, however."
msgstr ""
"将 *value* 赋值给 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 *variable*\\ ，其中 *value* "
"可以是包含任意数量变量或数字的表达式。但是，不能对 *variable* 进行索引。"

msgid "Multiplying matrices (MULT)"
msgstr "矩阵乘法（MULT）"

msgid ""
"The strings *result* , *mat1* , *mat2* are the internal names of the "
"matrices. If *fac1* is not given, *fac1=1* is assumed. If *fac2* is not "
"given, *fac2=0* is assumed. If a backquote (‘) is appended to *mat1* or "
"*mat2* the corresponding matrix is transposed before the operation. If a "
"backquote is appended to *result*, the resulting matrix is transposed."
msgstr ""
"字符串 *result*\\ 、\\ *mat1*\\ 、\\ *mat2* 是矩阵的内部名称。如果未给出 *fac1*\\ ，则假定 "
"*fac1=1*\\ 。如果未给出 *fac2*\\ ，则假定 *fac2=0*\\ 。如果在 *mat1* 或 *mat2* "
"后附加反引号（‘），则在操作前转置相应的矩阵。如果在 *result* 后附加反引号，则转置结果矩阵。"

msgid "Transforming operators (TRAN)"
msgstr "变换算符（TRAN）"

msgid "Transforming density matrices into the MO basis (DMO)"
msgstr "将密度矩阵转换到 MO 基 (DMO)"

msgid "Diagonalizing a matrix DIAG"
msgstr "矩阵对角化 DIAG"

msgid ""
"Diagonalizes *matrix*. The eigenvectors and eigenvalues are stored "
"internally with associated names *eigvec* and *eigval*, respectively "
"(arbitrary strings of up to 16 characters). The if *iprint*.gt.0, the "
"eigenvalues are printed. If *iprint.gt.1*, also the eigenvectors are "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"对角化 *matrix*\\ 。特征向量和特征值分别以关联名称 *eigvec* 和 *eigval* 内部存储（任意字符串，最多16个字符）。如果 "
"*iprint*.gt.0，则打印特征值。如果 *iprint.gt.1*\\ ，同时打印特征向量。"

msgid "Generating natural orbitals (NATORB)"
msgstr "生成自然轨道 (NATORB)"

msgid ""
"computes natural orbitals for density matrix *dens*. Orbitals with "
"occupation numbers greater or equal to *thresh* (default 1.d-4) are printed."
msgstr "计算密度矩阵 *dens* 的自然轨道。占据数大于或等于 *thresh*\\ （默认 1.d-4）的轨道将被打印。"

msgid "Forming an outer product of two vectors (OPRD)"
msgstr "形成两个向量的外积 (OPRD)"

msgid ""
"Takes the column vectors *v1* and *v2* from *matrix* and adds their outer "
"product to *result*. *v1* and *v2* must be given in the form *icol.isym*, "
"e.g., 3.2 means the third vector in symmetry 2. The result is"
msgstr ""
"从 *matrix* 中取出列向量 *v1* 和 *v2*\\ ，并将它们的外积加到 *result* 上。\\ *v1* 和 *v2* 必须以 "
"*icol.isym* 的形式给出，例如，3.2 表示对称性 2 中的第三个向量。结果为"

msgid ":math:`result(a,b)=result(a,b) + factor*v1(a)*v2(b)`"
msgstr ":math:`result(a,b)=result(a,b) + factor*v1(a)*v2(b)`"

msgid ""
"If *result* has not been used before, it is zeroed before performing the "
"operation."
msgstr "如果 *result* 之前未被使用过，则在执行操作前会先将其清零。"

msgid "Combining matrix columns (ADDVEC)"
msgstr "组合矩阵列 (ADDVEC)"

msgid ""
"Takes the column vector *orbs* from *source* and adds it to column *orbr* of"
" *result*. *v1* and *v2* must be given in the form *icol.isym*, e.g., 3.2 "
"means the third vector in symmetry 2."
msgstr ""
"从 *source* 中取出列向量 *orbs* 并将其加到 *result* 的 *orbr* 列上。\\ *v1* 和 *v2* 必须以 "
"*icol.isym* 的形式给出，例如 3.2 表示对称性 2 中的第三个向量。"

msgid "Forming a closed-shell density matrix (DENS)"
msgstr "形成闭壳层密度矩阵 (DENS)"

msgid "Computing a fock matrix (FOCK)"
msgstr "计算 Fock 矩阵 (FOCK)"

msgid ""
"computes a closed shell fock matrix using density *d*. The result is stored "
"in *f*."
msgstr "使用密度 *d* 计算闭壳层 Fock 矩阵。结果存储在 *f* 中。"

msgid "Computing a coulomb operator (COUL)"
msgstr "计算 Coulomb 算符 (COUL)"

msgid "computes a coulomb operator J(d) using density *d*."
msgstr "使用密度 *d* 计算 Coulomb 算符 J(d)。"

msgid "Computing an exchange operator (EXCH)"
msgstr "计算交换算符 (EXCH)"

msgid "computes an exchange operator K(d) using density *d*."
msgstr "使用密度 *d* 计算交换算符 K(d)。"

msgid "Printing matrices (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印矩阵 (PRINT)"

msgid ""
"prints matrix *name*. *ncol(isym)* is the number of columns to be printed "
"for row symmetry *isym* (if not given, all columns are printed). For "
"printing orbitals one can also use ``ORB``."
msgstr ""
"打印矩阵 *name*\\ 。\\ *ncol(isym)* 是为行对称性 *isym* 打印的列数（如果未给出，则打印所有列）。打印轨道时也可以使用 "
"``ORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Printing diagonal elements of a matrix (PRID)"
msgstr "打印矩阵的对角元 (PRID)"

msgid "``PRID``,\\ *name* prints the diagonal elements of matrix *name*."
msgstr "``PRID``,\\ *name* 打印矩阵 *name* 的对角元。"

msgid "Printing orbitals (PRIO)"
msgstr "打印轨道 (PRIO)"

msgid ""
"prints orbitals *name*. The first :math:`n_i` orbitals are printed in "
"symmetry :math:`i`. If :math:`n_i=0`, all orbitals of that symmetry are "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"打印轨道 *name*\\ 。前 :math:`n_i` 个轨道在对称性 :math:`i` 中打印。若 :math:`n_i=0`\\ "
"，则打印该对称性的所有轨道。"

msgid "Printing a matrix transpose in scientific notation(PRIC)"
msgstr "以科学计数法打印矩阵转置(PRIC)"

msgid ""
"prints the transpose of matrix *name* in scientific notation (comma "
"delimited). *ncol(isym)* is the number of columns to be printed for row "
"symmetry *isym* (if not given, all columns are printed). For printing "
"orbitals one can also use ``ORB``."
msgstr ""
"以科学计数法（逗号分隔）打印矩阵 *name* 的转置。\\ *ncol(isym)* 是为行对称性 *isym* "
"打印的列数（若未指定，则打印所有列）。打印轨道也可使用 ``ORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Assigning matrix elements to a variable (ELEM)"
msgstr "将矩阵元赋值给变量 (ELEM)"

msgid ""
"assigns elements (col,row) of *matrix* to variable *name*. *col* and *row* "
"must be given in the form *number.isym*, where *number* is the row or column"
" number in symmetry *isym*. The product of the row and column symmetries "
"must agree with the matrix symmetry."
msgstr ""
"将 *matrix* 的元 (col,row) 赋值给变量 *name*\\ 。\\ *col* 和 *row* 必须以 *number.isym* "
"形式给出，其中 *number* 是对称性 *isym* 中的行号或列号。行与列对称性的乘积必须与矩阵的对称性一致。"

msgid "Setting a matrix element to a variable (POKE)"
msgstr "将矩阵元设置为变量 (POKE)"

msgid ""
"sets elements (col,row) of *matrix* to variable *name*. *col* and *row* must"
" be given in the form *number.isym*, where *number* is the row or column "
"number in symmetry *isym*. The product of the row and column symmetries must"
" agree with the matrix symmetry."
msgstr ""
"将矩阵 *matrix* 的元素 (列,行) 设置为变量 *name*\\ 。\\ *col* 和 *row* 必须以 *number.isym* "
"的形式给出，其中 *number* 是\\ *对称性* *isym* 中的行号或列号。行与列的对称性乘积必须与矩阵的对称性一致。"

msgid "Reading a matrix from the input file (READ)"
msgstr "从输入文件读取矩阵 (READ)"

msgid ""
"Reads a square matrix (symmetry 1) from input or an ASCII file. The *values*"
" can be in free format, but their total number must be correct. Comment "
"lines starting with ’#’, ’\\*’, or ’!’ are skipped. If the data are given in"
" input, the data block must be enclosed either by curly brackets or the "
"first line must be ``BEGIN_DATA`` and the last line ``END_DATA``. If a "
"*filename* is specified as option, the data are read from this file. In this"
" case, the ``BEGIN_DATA``, ``END_DATA`` lines in the file are optional, and "
"no data block must follow. If ``TRANS`` is given, the matrix is read "
"columnwise, otherwise rowwise"
msgstr ""
"从输入或 ASCII 文件读取一个方阵（对称性 1）。\\ *values* 可以是自由格式，但其总数必须正确。以 '#'、'\\*' 或 '!' "
"开头的注释行将被跳过。如果数据在输入中给出，数据块必须用花括号括起来，或者第一行必须是 ``BEGIN_DATA``，最后一行是 "
"``END_DATA``。如果指定了 *\\ filename* 选项，则从该文件读取数据。在这种情况下，文件中的 ``BEGIN_DATA``\\ "
"、\\ ``END_DATA`` 行是可选的，并且后面不能有数据块。如果给出 ``TRANS``\\ ，则按列读取矩阵，否则按行读取。"

msgid ""
"For compatibility with older versions, the data can also be included in the "
"input using the ``INCLUDE`` command (see section `input format "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#input-format>`__). In this case, "
"the include file must contain the ``BEGIN_DATA`` and ``END_DATA`` lines "
"(this is automatically the case if the file has been written using the "
"``MATROP,WRITE`` directive)."
msgstr ""
"为了与旧版本兼容，数据也可以使用 ``INCLUDE`` 命令包含在输入中（参见 `input format "
"<definition_of_molpro_input_language.html#input-format>`__ "
"部分）。在这种情况下，包含文件必须包含 ``BEGIN_DATA`` 和 ``END_DATA`` 行（如果文件是使用 ``MATROP,WRITE``"
" 指令写入的，则自动满足此条件）。"

msgid ""
"*type* is a string which can be used to assign a matrix type. If "
"appropriate, this should be any of the ones used in the ``LOAD`` command. In"
" addition, ``SUBTYPE`` can be specified if necessary. This describes, e.g., "
"the type of orbitals or density matrices (e.g., for natural orbitals "
"*TYPE*\\ =\\ ``ORB`` and *SUBTYPE*\\ =\\ ``NATURAL``). The matrix symmetry "
"needs to be given only if it is not equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"*type* 是一个字符串，可用于分配矩阵类型。如果适用，这应该是 ``LOAD`` 命令中使用的任何一种。此外，如果需要，可以指定 "
"``SUBTYPE``\\ 。这描述了例如轨道或密度矩阵的类型（例如，对于自然轨道，\\ *TYPE*\\ =\\ ``ORB`` 且 "
"*SUBTYPE*\\ =\\ ``NATURAL``\\ ）。仅当矩阵对称性不等于 1 时才需要给出。"

msgid "Writing a matrix to an ASCII file (WRITE)"
msgstr "将矩阵写入ASCII文件（WRITE）"

msgid ""
"Writes a matrix to an ASCII file. If *filename* is not given the matrix is "
"written to the output file, otherwise to the specified file (*filename* is "
"converted to lower case). If *filename*\\ =\\ ``PUNCH`` it is written to the"
" current punch file."
msgstr ""
"将矩阵写入ASCII文件。如果未指定\\ *filename*\\ ，矩阵将写入输出文件；否则写入指定文件（\\ *filename*\\ "
"会转换为小写）。如果\\ *filename*\\ =\\ ``PUNCH``\\ ，则写入当前punch文件。"

msgid ""
"If *status*\\ =\\ ``NEW``, ``ERASE`` or ``REWIND``, a new file is written, "
"otherwise as existing file is appended."
msgstr "如果\\ *status*\\ =\\ ``NEW``\\ 、\\ ``ERASE``\\ 或\\ ``REWIND``\\ ，则写入新文件；否则追加到现有文件。"

msgid ""
"If *format*\\ =\\ ``SCIENTIFIC``, or ``FLOAT`` the output is given in the "
"scientific notation (floating point)."
msgstr "如果\\ *format*\\ =\\ ``SCIENTIFIC``\\ 或\\ ``FLOAT``\\ ，输出将以科学计数法（浮点数）给出。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "The following example shows various uses of the ``MATROP`` commands."
msgstr "以下示例展示了\\ ``MATROP``\\ 命令的各种用法。"

msgid ""
"This second example adds a quadrupole field to ``H0``. The result is exactly"
" the same as using the ``QUAD`` command. ``H0`` is overwritten by the "
"modified one-electron matrix, and the nuclear energy is automatically "
"changed appropriately. The subsequent SCF calculations use the modified one-"
"electron operator."
msgstr ""
"第二个示例向\\ ``H0``\\ 添加四极场。结果与使用\\ ``QUAD``\\ 命令完全相同。\\ ``H0``\\ "
"被修改后的单电子矩阵覆盖，核能量会自动相应调整。随后的SCF计算将使用修改后的单电子算符。"

msgid ""
"Note that it is usually recommended to add fields with the D͡IP, ``QUAD``, "
"or ``FIELD`` commands."
msgstr "请注意，通常建议使用 D͡IP、\\ ``QUAD`` 或 ``FIELD`` 命令来添加场。"

msgid "Exercise: SCF program"
msgstr "练习：SCF 程序"

msgid "Hints:"
msgstr "提示："

msgid ""
"First generate a starting orbital guess by finding the eigenvectors of *h0*."
" Store the orbitals in a record. Basis and geometry are defined in the usual"
" way before the first call to ``MATROP``."
msgstr ""
"首先通过寻找 *h0* 的特征向量来生成一个初始轨道初猜。将轨道存储在记录中。基组和几何结构在首次调用 ``MATROP`` 之前以常规方式定义。"

msgid ""
"Then use a ``MOLPRO``\\   ``DO`` loop and call ``MATROP`` for each "
"iteration. Save the current energy in a variable (note that the nuclear "
"energy is stored in variable ``ENUC``). Also, compute the dipole moment in "
"each iteration. At the end of the iteration perform a convergence test on "
"the energy change using the ``IF`` command. This must be done outside "
"``MATROP`` just before the ``ENDDO``. At this stage, you can also store the "
"iteration numbers, energies, and dipole moments in arrays, and print these "
"after reaching convergence using ``TABLE``. For the following geometry and "
"basis set"
msgstr ""
"然后使用一个 ``MOLPRO``\\   ``DO`` 循环并在每次迭代中调用 ``MATROP``\\ "
"。将当前能量保存在一个变量中（注意核能量存储在变量 ``ENUC`` 中）。同时，在每次迭代中计算偶极矩。在迭代结束时，使用 ``IF`` "
"命令对能量变化进行收敛性测试。这必须在 ``MATROP`` 之外、紧邻 ``ENDDO`` "
"之前完成。在此阶段，您还可以将迭代次数、能量和偶极矩存储在数组中，并在达到收敛后使用 ``TABLE`` 打印这些数据。对于以下几何结构和基组"

msgid "the result could look as follows:"
msgstr "结果可能如下所示："

msgid "It does not converge terribly fast, but it works!"
msgstr "它的收敛速度不算很快，但确实有效！"

msgid "``MATROP;``"
msgstr "``MATROP;``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,ORB [,record] [,specifications]``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,ORB [,record] [,specifications]``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,DEN [,record] [,specifications]``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,DEN [,record] [,specifications]``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,S``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,S``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,SMH``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,SMH``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,H0``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,H0``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,H01``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,H01``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,EKIN``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,EKIN``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,EPOT``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,EPOT``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,OPER,opname,[isym],x,y,z``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,OPER,opname,[isym],x,y,z``"

msgid ""
"loads one-electron operator *opname*, where *opname* is a keyword specifying"
" the operator (a component must be given). See section `One-electron "
"operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-"
"electron-operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ for valid keys. *isym* "
"is the total symmetry of the operator (default 1). If just the operator name"
" is given, it is computed at the origin. If the operator name is appended by"
" a center number in parenthesis, it is computed at this center [e.g. "
"``DELTA(1)``]. If it is appended by (0), it is computed at the given "
"coordinates *x,y,z* (in a.u.), e.g. ``DELTA(0),,0,0,4``"
msgstr ""
"载入单电子算符 *opname*\\ ，其中 *opname* 是指定该算符的关键字（必须给定一个分量）。有效关键字参见 `One-electron "
"operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-"
"electron-operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ 一节。\\ *isym* "
"为该算符的总对称性（默认 1）。若只给出算符名，则在该原点处计算。若算符名后括号中附加了中心编号，则在该中心处计算[例如 "
"``DELTA(1)``]。若附加了 (0)，则在给定的坐标 *x,y,z*\\ （单位 a.u.）处计算，例如 ``DELTA(0),,0,0,4``"

msgid "``LOAD,name,TRIANG,record,[isym] LOAD,name,SQUARE,record,[isym]``"
msgstr "``LOAD,name,TRIANG,record,[isym] LOAD,name,SQUARE,record,[isym]``"

msgid "``SAVE,name,record [,type],[subtype]``"
msgstr "``SAVE,name,record [,type],[subtype]``"

msgid ""
"``SAVE,name,OPER, [PARITY=np], [NUC=opnuc], CENTRE=icen],[COORD=[x,y,z]]``"
msgstr ""
"``SAVE,name,OPER, [PARITY=np], [NUC=opnuc], CENTRE=icen],[COORD=[x,y,z]]``"

msgid "``ADD,result [,fac1],mat1 [,fac2],mat2,…``"
msgstr "``ADD,result [,fac1],mat1 [,fac2],mat2,…``"

msgid ""
"calculates *result = fac1 :math:`\\cdot` mat1 + fac2 :math:`\\cdot` mat2* + "
"…"
msgstr "计算 *result = fac1 :math:`\\cdot` mat1 + fac2 :math:`\\cdot` mat2* + …"

msgid "``TRACE,variable, mat1,,[factor]``"
msgstr "``TRACE,variable, mat1,,[factor]``"

msgid "``TRACE,variable, mat1, mat2,[factor],[facnuc]``"
msgstr "``TRACE,variable, mat1, mat2,[factor],[facnuc]``"

msgid ""
"Computes *variable* = *factor*\\*trace(*mat1 :math:`\\cdot` mat2*) + "
"facnuc\\*opnuc."
msgstr ""

msgid "``SET,variable,value``"
msgstr "``SET,variable,value``"

msgid "``MULT,result, mat1, mat2,[fac1],[fac2]``"
msgstr "``MULT,result, mat1, mat2,[fac1],[fac2]``"

msgid "calculates *result = fac2 \\* result + fac1 \\* mat1 :math:`\\cdot` mat2*"
msgstr "计算 *result = fac2 \\* result + fac1 \\* mat1 :math:`\\cdot` mat2*"

msgid "``TRAN,result, Op, C``"
msgstr "``TRAN,result, Op, C``"

msgid ""
"calculates *result* = *C(T)\\*Op\\*C*. The strings *result*, *C*, and *Op* "
"are the internal names of the matrices. If a backquote (‘) is appended to "
"*C* or *Op* the corresponding matrix is transposed before the operation. "
"Thus,"
msgstr ""
"计算 *result* = *C(T)\\*\\ Op\\*C*\\ 。字符串 *result*\\ 、\\ *C* 和 *Op* "
"为矩阵的内部名称。若在 *C* 或 *Op* 后附加反引号（‘），则相应矩阵在运算前先转置。因此，"

msgid "``TRAN,result, Op, C‘``"
msgstr "``TRAN,result, Op, C‘``"

msgid "computes *result* = *C\\*Op\\*C(T)*."
msgstr "计算 *result* = *C\\*\\ Op\\*C(T)*\\ 。"

msgid "``DMO,result, D, C``"
msgstr "``DMO,result, D, C``"

msgid ""
"calculates *result* = *C(T)\\*S\\*D\\*S\\*C*. The strings *result*, *C*, and"
" *D* are internal names."
msgstr "计算 *result* = *C(T)\\*\\ S\\*D\\*\\ S\\*C*\\ 。字符串 *result*\\ 、\\ *C* 和 *D* 为内部名称。"

msgid "``DIAG,eigvec,eigval,matrix [,iprint]``"
msgstr "``DIAG,eigvec,eigval,matrix [,iprint]``"

msgid "``NATORB,name,dens,thresh``"
msgstr "``NATORB,name,dens,thresh``"

msgid "``OPRD,result,matrix,orb1,orb2,factor``"
msgstr "``OPRD,result,matrix,orb1,orb2,factor``"

msgid "``ADDVEC,result,orbr,source,orbs,factor``"
msgstr "``ADDVEC,result,orbr,source,orbs,factor``"

msgid "``DENS,density,orbitals,iocc$_1$, iocc$_2 \\ldots$``"
msgstr "``DENS,density,orbitals,iocc$_1$, iocc$_2 \\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"Forms a closed-shell density matrix *density* from the given *orbitals*. The"
" number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry :math:`i` must be provided in "
"*iocc:math:`_i`*."
msgstr ""
"由给定的 *orbitals* 构造闭壳层密度矩阵 *density*\\ 。每个对称性 :math:`i` 中的占据轨道数目必须在 "
"*iocc:math:`_i`* 中提供。"

msgid "``FOCK,f,d``"
msgstr "``FOCK,f,d``"

msgid "``COUL,J,d``"
msgstr "``COUL,J,d``"

msgid "``EXCH,K,d``"
msgstr "``EXCH,K,d``"

