"``READ``,\\ *name*,[[TYPE=]\\ *type*],[[SUBTYPE=]\\ *subtype*],[[SYM=]\\ "
"*symmetry*], [FILE=\\ *file*],[TRANS] { *values* }"
msgstr ""
"``READ``,\\ *name*,[[TYPE=]\\ *type*],[[SUBTYPE=]\\ *subtype*],[[SYM=]\\ "
"*symmetry*], [FILE=\\ *file*],[TRANS] { *values* }"

